WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Jesus' first words in Mark:
The time is fulfilled,

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.970
and God's Kingdom is at hand!

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.800
But this Kingdom is not a place on a map.

4
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:11.700
It is God's reign.

5
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.330
To explain it, Jesus tells
stories about farming.

6
00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.840
Seed falls on a path, on
rocky ground and among thorns.

7
00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.170
Birds, sun and thorns take much of it.

8
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.800
So why describe God's Kingdom
as a seed, and not as a palace?

9
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:32.970
In this mission, you'll decode the
parables Jesus tells about seed and soil.

10
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.650
Then you'll weigh up whether the Kingdom
is more about the future than the present.

11
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:42.460
Your mission: find out why Jesus
described God's Kingdom as a seed,

12
00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.550
not a palace.
